e distribution with shared dependencies across capabilities, so per-ca"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"pability uninstall cannot be done safely.\n- `edu-agent` is skill-only and not bundled here; `api` is"},{"id":"p26s5","text":" the core and cannot be disabled."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## UI Overview"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"After installing and configuring, open **Settings → Qwen 多模态** (in the left nav, alongside General, "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"Models, and the rest) — the page looks like this:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- **Qwen API Key card**: paste the Qwen API Key from Alibaba Cloud Model Studio and click **保存** — i"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"t takes effect immediately. The dot on the top-right shows the state (green = configured, red = not "},{"id":"p29s3","text":"configured).\n- **Capability card**: lists all 8 capabilities, each row with the capability name, a s"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"tate badge (not installed / disabled / enabled / installing…), and an action button (install / enabl"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"e / disable); missing system dependencies are called out (e.g. blender shows 「缺系统依赖：blender」 in the "},{"id":"p29s6","text":"screenshot).\n- **Live status**: state refreshes right after a button click, and post-install depende"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"ncy probes sync to the page within seconds."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Keys go through the DSH credentials seam (`ctx.credentials`, ref `QMP_DASHSCOPE_API_KEY`); the pag"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e uses the baked `api.credentials.{describe,set}` remotes — the official third-party path in rc.6, w"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"hose settings boundary is an explicit allowlist.\n- Capability status is pushed via the `qwen-mm-caps"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"` session projection; actions run through the `/qwen-mm …` command channel, with status re-folding o"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"n the command lifecycle.\n- The key is injected into MCP children via env vars; `credentials/updated`"},{"id":"p31s6","text":" re-spawns the child after a save."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Notes & Limitations"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- Media is preprocessed locally then uploaded to DashScope — do not use with sensitive content.\n- `g"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"itTag` defaults to `qwen-mm-plugins-api-v1.0.3`; bump it to follow upstream releases."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

