t":" re-spawns the child after a save."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Notes & Limitations"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- Media is preprocessed locally then uploaded to DashScope — do not use with sensitive content.\n- `g"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"itTag` defaults to `qwen-mm-plugins-api-v1.0.3`; bump it to follow upstream releases."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["evidence","evidence"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
